ll-based action roguelite where you imbue your weapons with chemickals to exploit enemy weaknesses. Master alchemy, customize your arsenal, and survive the depths of an arcane invasion!","steam_appid":3107030,"support_info":{"email":"rodboticaldev@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}